('127.404.d.12.I',4,'In a weighted decision matrix, a more important criterion receives a:','["random weight", "zero weight", "higher weight", "lower weight"]'::jsonb,2,'Weights reflect importance.','original'),
('127.404.d.13.A',3,'A professional presentation uses clear slides, eye contact, and:','["slang only", "reading every word", "mumbling", "organized, rehearsed delivery"]'::jsonb,3,'Preparation shows professionalism.','original'),
('127.404.d.13.A',4,'Slides that carry too much text can cause the audience to:','["stop listening to the speaker", "learn faster", "applaud", "remember more"]'::jsonb,0,'Dense slides distract.','original'),
