('127.404.d.13.B',4,'A team evaluates feedback by deciding which suggestions are:','["most numerous", "first", "practical and supported by evidence", "loud"]'::jsonb,2,'Judge usefulness.','original'),
('127.404.d.13.C',3,'A reflection after a project might list teamwork skills gained and:','["jokes", "trophies", "passwords", "areas that need growth"]'::jsonb,3,'Reflection guides improvement.','original'),
('127.404.d.13.C',4,'Setting a goal to improve time management after a late project is an example of:','["using reflection to plan growth", "avoiding projects", "ignoring lessons", "blaming the team"]'::jsonb,0,'Learning leads to goals.','original'),
('127.405.d.1',3,'An engineer on a bridge project notices cracks that the owner wants kept quiet. The ethical choice is to:','["agree to stay silent", "report the cracks through proper channels", "fix them secretly", "leave the job"]'::jsonb,1,'Public safety outranks convenience.','original'),
