('127.405.d.3.D',3,'Keeping drawings, reports, and emails in organized folders is part of:','["advertising", "document management", "shipping", "recruiting"]'::jsonb,1,'Organization saves time.','original'),
('127.405.d.3.D',4,'A numbering system for drawing revisions prevents the team from using:','["clean files", "backups", "outdated information", "new tools"]'::jsonb,2,'Revision control avoids errors.','original'),
('127.405.d.3.E',3,'A requirement that a device must weigh under 2 kg is a:','["color", "suggestion", "joke", "constraint on the design"]'::jsonb,3,'Requirements limit design.','original'),
('127.405.d.3.E',4,'When a deliverable changes from a paper report to a working model, the team must adjust the:','["schedule and resources", "team shirts", "office layout", "project name"]'::jsonb,0,'Changes affect plans.','original'),
('127.405.d.3.F',3,'The budget for a robot project includes parts, equipment, and:','["weather", "labor hours", "snacks only", "rumors"]'::jsonb,1,'Labor is a cost.','original'),
('127.405.d.3.F',4,'If a team spends $620 of a $800 budget, the remaining amount is:','["$1,420", "$220", "$180", "$120"]'::jsonb,2,'800 - 620 = 180.','original'),
('127.405.d.3.G',3,'Management of change is especially important in industries such as chemical processing because small changes can create:','["new colors", "fewer tasks", "better lunches", "new safety risks"]'::jsonb,3,'Process changes can cause accidents.','original'),
('127.405.d.3.G',4,'A MOC form typically records what is changing, why, and who:','["approved the change", "joined the club", "ate lunch", "painted the shop"]'::jsonb,0,'Approvals create accountability.','original')
) as v(code, diff, prompt, choices, ans, expl, src)
join public.teks_items i on i.code = v.code and i.is_standard
